  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KLTN.Game.Presentation.CardLoreProfile
  role: "H\u1ED7 tr\u1EE3"
  skillDescription: "[Chi ti\u1EBFt k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng]\n- Khi m\u1ED9t \u0111\u1ED3ng
    minh ch\u1EBFt, g\xE2y 1 ST v\xE0o m\xE1u ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i \u0111\u1ED1i
    th\u1EE7."
  folklore: "Ta l\xE0 vong nhi \u2014 linh h\u1ED3n tr\u1EBB nh\u1ECF ch\u1EBFt y\u1EC3u
    ho\u1EB7c ch\u01B0a k\u1ECBp ch\xE0o \u0111\u1EDDi, kh\xF4ng n\u01A1i n\u01B0\u01A1ng
    t\u1EF1a. Trong chuy\u1EC7n d\xE2n gian, ti\u1EBFng kh\xF3c c\u1EE7a ta n\u01A1i
    hoang v\u1EAFng nh\u1EAFc ng\u01B0\u1EDDi s\u1ED1ng th\u01B0\u01A1ng x\xF3t v\xE0
    l\xE0m l\u1EC5 c\u1EA7u si\xEAu."
